          "line_end": 76,
          "line_start": 76,
          "path": "README.md",
          "repository": "agentsmesh/agentsmesh",
          "url": "https://github.com/AgentsMesh/AgentsMesh/blob/1f90b14194d03c353df4f281a05442afe93cae34/README.md#L76-L76"
        },
        {
          "commit": "1f90b14194d03c353df4f281a05442afe93cae34",
          "git_sha": "ffb1eb121c3438b6ec954b7f8f0ac74b35a2d9df",
          "line_end": 63,
          "line_start": 63,
          "path": "README.md",
          "repository": "agentsmesh/agentsmesh",
          "url": "https://github.com/AgentsMesh/AgentsMesh/blob/1f90b14194d03c353df4f281a05442afe93cae34/README.md#L63-L63"
        }
      ],
      "review_state": "mechanically_checked",
      "slice_ids": [
        "slc_6297d88b2643a98b67be8594849028422ae33465987b66a8b42a1a42e93930dc",
        "slc_c9a5088f41fe7d1d7a8d18fd975afcd50c0e9751dd33fbb19e70f3ecde37af66"
      ],
      "text": "The architecture splits control plane from data plane: orchestration travels over gRPC with mTLS while terminal I/O streams through a stateless Relay cluster, so the backend never handles PTY bytes."
    },
    {
      "basis": "documented",
      "claim_id": "clm_544297cb7fd13bf91d01e3b1292e917184328be5a05b2c4de84c8fc6e2bbf06d",
      "evidence_type": "organizational_statement",
      "facet": "orchestration",
      "kind": "observation",
      "locators": [
        {
          "commit": "1f90b14194d03c353df4f281a05442afe93cae34",
          "git_sha": "ffb1eb121c3438b6ec954b7f8f0ac74b35a2d9df",
          "line_end": 61,
          "line_start": 55,
          "path": "README.md",
          "repository": "agentsmesh/agentsmesh",
          "url": "https://github.com/AgentsMesh/AgentsMesh/blob/1f90b14194d03c353df4f281a05442afe93cae34/README.md#L55-L61"
        }
      ],
      "review_state": "mechanically_checked",
      "slice_ids": [
        "slc_32986783c5251d8589ba6b888ee1241dd65aaa20a4193be4e43c2e89ba322fc8"
      ],
      "text": "Runners advertise capacity (max_concurrent_pods) and pods are scheduled onto a chosen runner or an available one from the pool; each pod gets an isolated Git worktree sandbox, private credentials, and its own branch."
    },
    {
      "basis": "documented",
