  "summary": "Selected evidence records: Server side comprises a Go backend (Gin+GORM) handling auth, pod lifecycle, tickets, billing and runner-cert PKI; a WebSocket Relay for terminal data; and a self-hosted Go runner daemon that spawns PTY pods. Client side includes a Rust core of 10 crates compiled to WASM for web/desktop and exposed to iOS via UniFFI, plus Next.js web, Electron desktop, SwiftUI/TCA iOS, and a web-admin console.",
